      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/76d3ee/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-25T08:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cards in a pile face down.  Draw deck.<br>\nCards face up in a pile. Trash.<br>\nCards face up on table. In play.<br>\nCards drawn but not in play, generally held in your hand.  Your hand.</p>\n<p>Cards in your hand can be played, or discarded.<br>\nCards in your hand cannot be destroyed.<br>\nCards in play may be active, activated, or destroyed.<br>\nCards in play cannot be discarded.</p>",
