      "created_at": "2014-06-25T10:47:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"KainNived\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/76d3ee/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> KainNived:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Cards in a pile face down. Draw deck.<br>Cards face up in a pile. Trash.<br>Cards face up on table. In play.<br>Cards drawn but not in play, generally held in your hand. Your hand.</p>\n<p>Cards in your hand can be played, or discarded.<br>Cards in your hand cannot be destroyed.<br>Cards in play may be active, activated, or destroyed.<br>Cards in play cannot be discarded.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Discard? Destroy? Trash? What are these strange and mystic words? I only know of recycling and scrapping <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
