      "raw": "[quote=\"KainNived\"]\n\nCards in a pile face down. Draw deck.<br />Cards face up in a pile. Trash.<br />Cards face up on table. In play.<br />Cards drawn but not in play, generally held in your hand. Your hand.\n\nCards in your hand can be played, or discarded.<br />Cards in your hand cannot be destroyed.<br />Cards in play may be active, activated, or destroyed.<br />Cards in play cannot be discarded.\n\n[/quote]\n\nDiscard? Destroy? Trash? What are these strange and mystic words? I only know of recycling and scrapping :P\n",
