      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-27T11:17:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'd say that if you're in the process of applying a card's effect then it's in play - if it was in your hand, you wouldn't be applying its effect, and if it was in the trash/scrap, then you'd've already done that and finished with it.</p>",
